      "text": "The architecture pairs a React SPA (Vite + TypeScript) frontend with a FastAPI Python backend, backed by PostgreSQL for metadata, MinIO/S3 for file content, and LangChain-based AI providers, connected via REST, SSE, and WebSocket."
